#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to &marble;, a small interactive globe and geographical atlas that "
"puts the world at your fingertips. Just like a real atlas or a conventional "
"globe &marble; allows you to freely move across its map and lookup places. "
"Furthermore &marble; allows you to zoom in and have many different views on "
"the surface of the Earth. In its default configuration &marble; offers 11 "
"different views: <guilabel>Atlas</guilabel>, <guilabel>OpenStreetMap</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Satellite View</guilabel>, <guilabel>Earth at Night</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Historical Map 1689</guilabel>, <guilabel>Moon</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Plain Map</guilabel>, <guilabel>Precipitation "
"(December)</guilabel>, <guilabel>Precipitation (July)</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Temperature (December)</guilabel> and <guilabel>Temperature "
"(July)</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Recibe a benvida a &marble;, un pequeno globo interactivo e atlas xeográfico "
"que pon o mundo nas puntas dos teus dedos. Igual que un atlas real ou unha "
"bola do mundo convencional, &marble; permite moverse libremente entre os "
"lugares de mapas e de consulta. Alén disto, &marble; permite achegarse e ter "
"moitas vistas distintas da superficie da Terra. Nas súa configuración "
"predeterminada ofrece once vistas distintas: <guilabel>Atlas</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>OpenStreetMap</guilabel>, <guilabel>Vista de satélite</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>A Terra de noite</guilabel>, <guilabel>Mapa histórico de 1689</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Lúa</guilabel>, <guilabel>Mapa simple</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Precipitación (Decembro)</guilabel>, <guilabel>Precipitación "
"(Xullo)</guilabel>, <guilabel>Temperatura (Decembro)</guilabel> e "
"<guilabel>Temperatura (Xullo)</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&marble; comes with a small database of more than 12,000 locations "
#| "(cities, mountains, volcanoes) which can be searched for and which are "
#| "partially integrated with the popular Internet encyclopedia Wikipedia. "
#| "Additionally you can measure distances using &marble; between multiple "
#| "measure points which can be set freely."
msgid ""
"&marble; comes with a small database of more than 12,000 locations (cities, "
"mountains, volcanoes) which can be searched for and which are integrated "
"with Wikipedia. Additionally you can measure distances using &marble; "
"between multiple measure points which can be set freely."
msgstr ""
"O &marble; vén cunha pequena base de datos de máis de 12.000 lugares "
"(cidades, montañas, volcáns) que se poden buscar e que están parcialmente "
"integrados coa popular enciclopedia da Internet, a Wikipedia. Alén disto, no "
"&marble; pódense medir distancias entre varios lugares escollidos libremente."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
